      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I had this problem as well, but i seem to have fixed it.\n\nMy fix:\n\n1.) Go to https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/help/2977003/the-latest-supported-visual-c-downloads\n\n2.) Download both the x86 and x64 versions of Visual Studio 2017\n\n3.) Install both\n\n4.) You may have to restart your PC\n\nI hoped this helped!",
